    n: '4',
    t: 'Your Certificate Arrives',
    d: 'RAK ICC typically delivers in 3 to 5 working days. JAFZA in 5 to 7. Your full corporate kit follows, including the certificate of incorporation, share certificates and statutory registers.',
  },
